    ]
  },
  "StockRole": "Striker",
  "YangsThoughts": "The Hierofalcon is a medium Clan OmniMech designed primarily as a striker unit by Clan Jade Falcon. As part of the push to be ever more flexible in movement, the 'Mech features a 270-rated extralight engine, allowing the mech to move at speeds up to 97.2 km/h. The addition of a permanently equipped partial wing adds dual benefits, both increasing jump distance and cooling capabilities. The 'Mech's hull is protected by seven and a half tons of ferro-fibrous armor, giving it modest protection from enemy fire, while an ECM suite provides additional protection from other threats.",
